  "title": "Can you ...?",
  "objectives": [
    "会用 Can you ...? 询问别人的能力",
    "会用 Yes, I can / No, I can't 回答"
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "image",
      "src": "/content/yy-1a/img/yy-1a-u4-l03.webp",
      "alt": "Can you ...?的插图"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "问别人会不会",
      "content": "A: Can you sing? B: Yes, I can. / No, I can't. Can you ...? 就是“你会……吗？”"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "和 I can 的区别",
      "content": "I can sing. 是说自己会；Can you sing? 是问别人会。can't 是 cannot 的缩写。"
    }
  ],
